==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|aska|lang=non}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|is}} {{m|gem-pro|*askǭ}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈaska/|lang=is}}
*: {{rhymes|aska|lang=is}}

===Noun===
{{is-noun|f|ösku|-}}

# [[ashes]], [[ash]]
#: '''''Aska''' hylur [[vígvöllur|vígvöllinn]] eftir að sprengjurnar féllu.''
#:: The [[battlefield]] is covered in '''ashes''' after the bombs had fallen.

